730671", "assay_description": "Competitive Binding Assay: Competitive binding assays were performed by incubating rhER alpha (α) and beta 1 (β1) receptors with 10 nM [3H]estradiol (the radio ligand) in the presence or absence of increasing concentrations, 0.25 to 250,000 nM, of the phenolic test compounds of Tables 1 to 3 (nM is nano molar). Each data point is the average of at least two assays. Stock solutions of the compounds of Tables 1 to 3 were prepared at 10×E-2 M in 100% ethanol, water or DMSO (dimethyl sulfoxide). Compounds were diluted 10 fold in binding buffer and then 1:4 in the final assay mix. The final concentration of ethanol or DMSO in the assay well was 5%. The highest concentration of the hydrolysis test compound was 2.5×E-4 M (250,000 nM). The residual monomers of Tables 1 to 3 were tested at seven concentrations over log increments. The lowest concentration was 2.5×E-10 M (0.25 nM).", "assay_type": "B", "assay_variant_accession": null, "assay_variant_mutation": null, "bao_endpoint": "BAO_0000190", "bao_format": "BAO_0000357", "bao_label": "single protein format", "canonical_smiles": "CC(C)(c1ccc(O)cc1)c1ccc(O)cc1", "data_validity_comment": null, "data_validity_description": null, "document_chembl_id": "CHEMBL5725373", "document_journal": null, "document_year": 2017, "ligand_efficiency": {"bei": "27.64", "le": "0.51", "lle": "2.89", "sei": "15.60"}, "modality": null, "molecule_chembl_id": "CHEMBL418971", "molecule_pref_name": "BISPHENOL A", "parent_molecule_chembl_id": "CHEMBL418971", "pchembl_value": "6.31", "potential_duplicate": 0, "qudt_units": "http://www.openphacts.org/units/Nanomolar", "record_id": 4160488, "relation": "=", "src_id": 37, "standard_flag": 1, "standard_relation": "=", "standard_text_value": null, "standard_type": "IC50", "standard_units": "nM", "standard_upper_value": null, "standard_value": "490.0", "target_chembl_id": "CHEMBL206", "target_organism": "Homo sapiens", "target_pref_name": "Estrogen receptor", "target_tax_id": "